{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Will you protect her\u2026 or will you be the next one needing help?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What seemed like the beginning of a perfect life together soon turns into a terrifying reality that feels impossible to control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;My Sleeping Girlfriend&quot;</strong> is a <strong>psychological horror game</strong> where you take on the role of a young man who, after moving in with his girlfriend, uncovers a dark secret: her seemingly harmless sleepwalking hides something truly terrifying.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Mission:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search for her</strong> in the darkness of a house that feels more hostile with each passing night.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Observe her carefully</strong>\u2014every step, every movement could be a warning\u2026 or a trap.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make quick decisions</strong> to prevent something terrible from happening. Her safety is in your hands\u2026 but so is your own.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing is what it seems, and your actions each night could mean the difference between a bad dream\u2026 and a true nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will you do when the real horror isn\u2019t her\u2026 but yourself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\u00a0<strong><i>Content Warning: </i></strong><i>This game contains <strong>violent scenes, disturbing images, and unsettling moments</strong>, which may not be suitable for all players.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3481710?t=1760716389","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3481710?t=1760716389","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3